<h3>Tagging Software</h3>
<p>
	<b>Tango Tagger</b> is a foobar2000 component (Windows and macOS) that writes tango lyrics into your music files.
	Select tracks and choose <em>Tango Tagger &gt; Find lyrics...</em>: titles are matched against the lyrics built into the component, and the checked matches are written to the files, optionally followed by links to the song's translations from this database.
	A <em>Lyrics</em> panel shows the lyrics of the selected or playing track with its composer and lyricist.
</p>
<p>
	Download it from the <%= link_to "TangoTagger releases page", "https://github.com/shaforostoff/tangomatcher/releases", target: '_blank' %>.
</p>
